<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman sets Energy target.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman sets Energy target.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of Energy Group Plc with a 12-month &quot;fair value&quot; price target of 592p, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock was up 27-1/2p at 552-1/2 by 1235 GMT, as it began trading following its demerger from Hanson Plc. The stock was buoyed by an agreed bid for Yorkshire Electricity Plc.</p>
<p>Further details on Goldman's comment on Energy Group were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
